          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: The observation of 21 yellow-orange balls crossing the sky in a few minutes, on a weekend night, strongly resembles Thai lanterns, likely released nearby after a private party. The observed movement from NE to SO is consistent with the NE wind reported in Strasbourg: Weather. The witness reports no wind, but the wind measured was quite strong, from 20 to 30 km/h. The witness was sheltered by houses. The witness had time to take photos and videos. No other testimony was collected. The GEIPAN classifies this case as \"B\", probable observation of Thai lanterns.",
